{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南天竺般若菩提悉曇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古謂楚書曰胡文者。案西域記。其閻浮地之南五天之境。楚人居焉。地周九萬餘里。三垂大海\n北背雪山。時無輪王膺運。中分七十餘國。其總曰五天竺。亦曰身毒。或云印度。有曰大夏是也。人遠承梵王。雖\n大分四姓。通謂之婆羅門國。佛現於其中。非胡土也。而雪山之北傍臨葱嶺。即胡人居焉。其字元製有異。良以境\n\n隣天竺文字參涉。所來經論咸依梵挾。而風俗則効習其文粗有增損。自古求請佛經多。於彼獲之。魚魯渾淆直\n曰胡文謬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸章用之多屬第八及成當體重或\n不成字如後具論也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除羅字羅鑒反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除囉羅二字。即第二第三及第八第九第十章也。字\n非重成簡於第一。故云餘單章也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重成也。即第四五六七及第十一已下四章\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即盎迦章字牙齒舌\n等句末之第五字。為上四字所用。亦不可更自重故除之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿阿等韻生字用十摩多。後字傍\n點名毘灑勒沙尼此云去聲。非為摩多。訖里章用一別摩多。里耶半體。用祗耶兼半體囉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "枳字幾爾反。\n今詳祗耶當是耶字之省也。若然亦同除重。唯有三百八十四。先書字體三百九十六。然將祗耶合之後加摩多。夫\n重成之字。下者皆省除頭也。已下並同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上略\n力價反。下略力迦反。上迦下迦並同略之平上取聲他皆効之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攞字洛可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚩字房可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勒字力德反下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若祗耶是耶省亦同\n除重"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略平上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盎字阿黨反。安字並阿亶反。唵字阿感反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或有加前麼多得成字用。非遍能生。且據本字言之。今詳訖里之麼多祗是\n悉曇中里字也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂多闍吒拏等字各有重成也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂悉多羅等是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即瑟吒羅\n等字。有通三五麼多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即阿悉多羅等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五\n句之末字。加其句之初。即名盎迦等屬前章也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如麼盎迦三合等字。似云莾迦等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如沙字有\n沙孚（府珂反）二音猶假借也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如部林二合字。從裒（菩侯反）婁（力鉤反）與第十一摩多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如字之上有仰月之畫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂數字重成一字。而其下必正呼。中上連合短呼之。不必正其音。如上娑下迦稱阿索迦等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即阿索迦章等字字則無阿。讀之皆帶其音也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如怛達祗耶等用則有之字體無也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如迦佉等字下有達畫則云秸（吉八反）稧（苦八\n反）等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如室梨字猶有奢羅之象。錯成印文。若篆籀\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "訖里俱羅俱婁等從迦之省。及胡盧等文。麼多之\n異猶艸隸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上題目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲短呼音近惡引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依聲長呼別體作􇇰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲聲近於翼反別體作􇗴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依字長呼別體作􇗼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲聲近屋別體作􈏽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長呼別體作􈏼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲聲近櫻係反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近於界反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲近污別體作􆿑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依字長呼別體作􆿒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲聲近於鑒反別體作􈆰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲近惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矩侯反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "區侯反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瞿侯反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰字母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居下反音近姜可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去下反音近去可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "渠下反輕音音近其下反。餘國有音疑可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重音渠我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魚下反音近魚可反。餘國有音􄑰講反。別體作􄑰加麼多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止下反音近作可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昌下反音近倉可反。別體作􇩹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杓下反輕音音近作可反。餘國有音而下反別體作􈍖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重音音近昨我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而下反音近若我反。餘國有音壤。別體作􈍘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卓下反音近卓我反。別體作􄓚加麼多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拆下反音近折我反別體作􅙞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宅下反輕音。餘國有音搦下反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重音音近幢我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "搦下反音近搦我反。餘國有音拏講反別體作􈍙加麼多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "怛下反音近多可反。別體作􈍠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他下反音近他可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大下反輕音餘國有音陀可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重音音近陀可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捺下反音近那可反。餘國有音音曩。別體作􈍢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𭽽下反音近波我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破下反音近破我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "罷下反輕音。餘國有音麼字下不尖異後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重音薄我反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "莫下反音近莫可反。餘國有音莽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藥下反音近藥可反又音祗也反譌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曷力下反三合。卷舌呼囉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洛下反音近洛可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "房下反音近房可反。舊又音和。一云字下尖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舍下反音近舍可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙下反音近沙可反。一音府下反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑下反音近娑可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "許下反音近許可反。一本音賀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力陷反音近郎紺反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楚下反音近楚可反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上第二章初字所生一十二文。後皆效此。讀者連帶。轉聲調韻呼之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上伽字上用􄑰盎字。冠之生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字同上迦字用麼多及呼字轉聲法。下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並將冠上四字之首。不復自重。後皆效此。已上牙聲之字。皆用盎聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字同上此􈍳是􄓎字之省"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為上四字所用。不可更自重。已上齒聲之字同用安音阿亶反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二安字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為上四字所用。不可更自重。此字有自重者便屬別章則大呼。拏音非盎拏也。餘並同此也。已上\n舌聲之字同用安聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為上四字所用。不可更自重。若重屬別章。已上喉聲之字同用安聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為上四字所用。不更自重。已上脣聲之字同用唵聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下並同吉里反。但用於下合之。讀者取其聲勢。亦有用麼多得重成字用。非遍能生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下各生十二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上一章重文讀之。皆帶阿聲連促呼之。此章亦除濫字。又合娑訶字唯三十三字。皆通十二\n字加麼多也。其於字母不次者。分入後章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並依本字大呼多。則不得云多多也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上麼下盎迦。後字之聲入\n於前。似云莽迦也。用此章字皆然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上字有第六及第十一麼多讀之皆帶兩聲也。此􇥙是第六麼多分布於傍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當是耶字。之省也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是室梨字西域為印也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T18n0850_p0083c06"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186002", "type": "mod", "text": "所【大】，攸【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186003", "type": "mod", "text": "楚【大】＊，梵【甲】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186004", "type": "mod", "text": "粗【大】，祖【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186005", "type": "mod", "text": "甲本梵字無＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186006", "type": "mod", "text": "囉【大】，羅【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186007", "type": "mod", "text": "也【大】，耶【校異-甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1186008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1186008", "type": "mod", "text": "嚩【大】＊，縛【甲】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "1187001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1187001", "type": "mod", "text": "訖【大】，紇【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1187002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1187002", "type": "mod", "text": "而也反二合【大】，二合而也反【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1187003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1187003", "type": "mod", "text": "反【大】，反􇩓【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188001", "type": "mod", "text": "􈍱【大】，􄑰【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188002", "type": "mod", "text": "􄑰加麼多【大】，加麼多􈍱【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188003", "type": "mod", "text": "􄒪【大】，􇩹【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188004", "type": "mod", "text": "􇩹【大】，􄒪【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188005", "type": "mod", "text": "􇟾【大】，􄓚【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188006", "type": "mod", "text": "􄓚【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188007", "type": "mod", "text": "多【大】，多􄓚􈍱【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188008", "type": "mod", "text": "􄕋【大】，􈍙【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188009", "type": "mod", "text": "􈍙加麼多【大】，􈑽􄕋【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188010", "type": "mod", "text": "􈍠【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188011", "type": "mod", "text": "反【大】，反􄽽􄕤【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188012", "type": "mod", "text": "那【大】，挪【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188013", "type": "mod", "text": "娑【大】，沙【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188014", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188014", "type": "mod", "text": "已【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188015", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188015", "type": "mod", "text": "􄗱【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1188016", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_1188016", "type": "mod", "text": "娜【大】，那【甲】"}
